{"schemaVersion":1,"generatedAt":"2026-08-16T16:20:46.501Z","id":"01834b48330e54295c869da7","canonicalUrl":"https://lore.kernel.org/r/CAEQ1D3kdA3mkQx7ei9Kq0gwky0qroJqCLKrkvgfkqgTbeu086A%40mail.gmail.com/","channels":["regressions"],"thread":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"thread:lore-git:CAEQ1D3kdA3mkQx7ei9Kq0gwky0qroJqCLKrkvgfkqgTbeu086A@mail.gmail.com","source":{"kind":"static-generated","canonicalThreadUrl":"https://lore.kernel.org/r/CAEQ1D3kdA3mkQx7ei9Kq0gwky0qroJqCLKrkvgfkqgTbeu086A%40mail.gmail.com/","fetchedAt":"2026-08-16T16:20:46.501Z","contentDigest":"lore-git:CAEQ1D3kdA3mkQx7ei9Kq0gwky0qroJqCLKrkvgfkqgTbeu086A@mail.gmail.com"},"subject":"Re: [REGRESSION] snd-usb-audio: SteelSeries Arctis Nova 5 mixer controls disabled as sticky","messages":{"931ce21d-6ec1-4502-bf5d-d3017626cc95@leemhuis.info":{"id":"931ce21d-6ec1-4502-bf5d-d3017626cc95@leemhuis.info","messageId":"931ce21d-6ec1-4502-bf5d-d3017626cc95@leemhuis.info","references":["CAEQ1D3kdA3mkQx7ei9Kq0gwky0qroJqCLKrkvgfkqgTbeu086A@mail.gmail.com"],"missingAncestorIds":["CAEQ1D3kdA3mkQx7ei9Kq0gwky0qroJqCLKrkvgfkqgTbeu086A@mail.gmail.com"],"author":{"name":"Thorsten Leemhuis","address":"regressions@leemhuis.info"},"replyTo":[],"to":[{"name":"Gert Burger","address":"gertburger@gmail.com"},{"name":"","address":"linux-sound@vger.kernel.org"}],"cc":[{"name":"","address":"regressions@lists.linux.dev"}],"timestamp":{"raw":"2026-08-05T16:08:15.000Z","iso":"2026-08-05T16:08:15.000Z","valid":true},"subject":"Re: [REGRESSION] snd-usb-audio: SteelSeries Arctis Nova 5 mixer controls disabled as sticky","mailingLists":[{"id":"regressions.lists.linux.dev","displayName":"regressions.lists.linux.dev"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"quote","attribution":"On 8/5/26 17:41, Gert Burger wrote:","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":"On archlinux, after I upgraded to kernel 7.1.5-arch1-2, the sound volume"},{"depth":1,"text":"is significantly lower and seems to lack bass."},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Reported by someone else here: https://bbs.archlinux.org/viewtopic.php?"},{"depth":1,"text":"id=314220 <https://bbs.archlinux.org/viewtopic.php?id=314220>"}],"lineCount":5,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"FWIW, somebody already linked to that exact report yesterday already and\nTakashi already replied with some thoughts:\nhttps://lore.kernel.org/all/20260804235515.7346606e.michal.pecio@gmail.com/"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Ciao, Thorsten"}],"patchIds":[],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":0,"diagnostics":[],"declaredParentMessageId":"CAEQ1D3kdA3mkQx7ei9Kq0gwky0qroJqCLKrkvgfkqgTbeu086A@mail.gmail.com"},"871pcbg3wr.wl-tiwai@suse.de":{"id":"871pcbg3wr.wl-tiwai@suse.de","messageId":"871pcbg3wr.wl-tiwai@suse.de","references":["CAEQ1D3kdA3mkQx7ei9Kq0gwky0qroJqCLKrkvgfkqgTbeu086A@mail.gmail.com"],"missingAncestorIds":["CAEQ1D3kdA3mkQx7ei9Kq0gwky0qroJqCLKrkvgfkqgTbeu086A@mail.gmail.com"],"author":{"name":"Takashi Iwai","address":"tiwai@suse.de"},"replyTo":[],"to":[{"name":"Gert Burger","address":"gertburger@gmail.com"}],"cc":[{"name":"","address":"linux-sound@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"regressions@lists.linux.dev"}],"timestamp":{"raw":"2026-08-06T06:27:00.000Z","iso":"2026-08-06T06:27:00.000Z","valid":true},"subject":"Re: [REGRESSION] snd-usb-audio: SteelSeries Arctis Nova 5 mixer controls disabled as sticky","mailingLists":[{"id":"regressions.lists.linux.dev","displayName":"regressions.lists.linux.dev"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"On Wed, 05 Aug 2026 17:41:27 +0200,\nGert Burger wrote:"},{"kind":"quote","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"On archlinux, after I upgraded to kernel 7.1.5-arch1-2, the sound volume is"},{"depth":1,"text":"significantly lower and seems to lack bass."},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Reported by someone else here: "},{"depth":1,"text":"https://bbs.archlinux.org/viewtopic.php?id=314220"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Previous kernel was 7.0.14.arch1-1 (working)"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Attached is also-info.sh for 7.1.5-arch1-2 (broken) and 6.18.41-1-lts (as a"},{"depth":1,"text":"workaround I installed an lts kernel, works)"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Device:"},{"depth":1,"text":"Bus 005 Device 003: ID 1038:2232 SteelSeries ApS SteelSeries Arctis Nova 5"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Dmesg diff:"},{"depth":1,"text":"Aug 05 16:22:19 framework kernel: usb 5-1.1: 9:0: sticky mixer values (-19712/"},{"depth":1,"text":"0/256 => 0), disabling"},{"depth":1,"text":"Aug 05 16:22:19 framework kernel: usb 5-1.1: 10:0: sticky mixer values (-21248"},{"depth":1,"text":"/0/256 => 0), disabling"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Can I need to provide anything else?"}],"lineCount":23,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Could you try 7.2 kernel?  I guess it's still broken, but then try to\npass the option \"quirk_flags=1038:2232:mixer_get_cur_broken\" to\nsnd-usb-audio module and retest?"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"thanks,"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Takashi"}],"patchIds":[],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":1,"diagnostics":[],"declaredParentMessageId":"CAEQ1D3kdA3mkQx7ei9Kq0gwky0qroJqCLKrkvgfkqgTbeu086A@mail.gmail.com"},"CAEQ1D3ky_7+g6_1J7ymxGUq4DNrPyx8OCsQ8Z42j2-XncMW8ZQ@mail.gmail.com":{"id":"CAEQ1D3ky_7+g6_1J7ymxGUq4DNrPyx8OCsQ8Z42j2-XncMW8ZQ@mail.gmail.com","messageId":"CAEQ1D3ky_7+g6_1J7ymxGUq4DNrPyx8OCsQ8Z42j2-XncMW8ZQ@mail.gmail.com","references":["CAEQ1D3kdA3mkQx7ei9Kq0gwky0qroJqCLKrkvgfkqgTbeu086A@mail.gmail.com","871pcbg3wr.wl-tiwai@suse.de"],"missingAncestorIds":[],"author":{"name":"Gert Burger","address":"gertburger@gmail.com"},"replyTo":[],"to":[{"name":"Takashi Iwai","address":"tiwai@suse.de"}],"cc":[{"name":"","address":"linux-sound@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"regressions@lists.linux.dev"}],"timestamp":{"raw":"2026-08-06T10:33:07.000Z","iso":"2026-08-06T10:33:07.000Z","valid":true},"subject":"Re: [REGRESSION] snd-usb-audio: SteelSeries Arctis Nova 5 mixer controls disabled as sticky","mailingLists":[{"id":"regressions.lists.linux.dev","displayName":"regressions.lists.linux.dev"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"quote","attribution":"On Thu, 6 Aug 2026 at 07:27, Takashi Iwai <tiwai@suse.de> wrote:","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"On Wed, 05 Aug 2026 17:41:27 +0200,"},{"depth":1,"text":"Gert Burger wrote:"},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":"> On archlinux, after I upgraded to kernel 7.1.5-arch1-2, the sound volume is"},{"depth":1,"text":"> significantly lower and seems to lack bass."},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":"> Reported by someone else here:"},{"depth":1,"text":"> https://bbs.archlinux.org/viewtopic.php?id=314220"},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":"> Previous kernel was 7.0.14.arch1-1 (working)"},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":"> Attached is also-info.sh for 7.1.5-arch1-2 (broken) and 6.18.41-1-lts (as a"},{"depth":1,"text":"> workaround I installed an lts kernel, works)"},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":"> Device:"},{"depth":1,"text":"> Bus 005 Device 003: ID 1038:2232 SteelSeries ApS SteelSeries Arctis Nova 5"},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":"> Dmesg diff:"},{"depth":1,"text":"> Aug 05 16:22:19 framework kernel: usb 5-1.1: 9:0: sticky mixer values (-19712/"},{"depth":1,"text":"> 0/256 => 0), disabling"},{"depth":1,"text":"> Aug 05 16:22:19 framework kernel: usb 5-1.1: 10:0: sticky mixer values (-21248"},{"depth":1,"text":"> /0/256 => 0), disabling"},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":"> Can I need to provide anything else?"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Could you try 7.2 kernel?  I guess it's still broken, but then try to"},{"depth":1,"text":"pass the option \"quirk_flags=1038:2232:mixer_get_cur_broken\" to"},{"depth":1,"text":"snd-usb-audio module and retest?"},{"depth":1,"text":""}],"lineCount":31,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"I tested with the `linux-mainline` package, currently on version 7.2rc5-1"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"# cat /etc/modprobe.d/snd-usb-audio.conf\noptions snd-usb-audio quirk_flags=1038:2232:mixer_get_cur_broken"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"That seems to have \"fixed\" it."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Thanks for the tip!"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Cheers\nGert Burger"}],"patchIds":[],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":2,"diagnostics":[],"declaredParentMessageId":"871pcbg3wr.wl-tiwai@suse.de","parentId":"871pcbg3wr.wl-tiwai@suse.de"},"87ecgbecy8.wl-tiwai@suse.de":{"id":"87ecgbecy8.wl-tiwai@suse.de","messageId":"87ecgbecy8.wl-tiwai@suse.de","references":["CAEQ1D3kdA3mkQx7ei9Kq0gwky0qroJqCLKrkvgfkqgTbeu086A@mail.gmail.com","871pcbg3wr.wl-tiwai@suse.de","CAEQ1D3ky_7+g6_1J7ymxGUq4DNrPyx8OCsQ8Z42j2-XncMW8ZQ@mail.gmail.com"],"missingAncestorIds":[],"author":{"name":"Takashi Iwai","address":"tiwai@suse.de"},"replyTo":[],"to":[{"name":"Gert Burger","address":"gertburger@gmail.com"}],"cc":[{"name":"Takashi Iwai","address":"tiwai@suse.de"},{"name":"","address":"linux-sound@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"regressions@lists.linux.dev"}],"timestamp":{"raw":"2026-08-06T10:54:39.000Z","iso":"2026-08-06T10:54:39.000Z","valid":true},"subject":"Re: [REGRESSION] snd-usb-audio: SteelSeries Arctis Nova 5 mixer controls disabled as sticky","mailingLists":[{"id":"regressions.lists.linux.dev","displayName":"regressions.lists.linux.dev"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"On Thu, 06 Aug 2026 12:33:07 +0200,\nGert Burger wrote:"},{"kind":"quote","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"On Thu, 6 Aug 2026 at 07:27, Takashi Iwai <tiwai@suse.de> wrote:"},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":"> On Wed, 05 Aug 2026 17:41:27 +0200,"},{"depth":1,"text":"> Gert Burger wrote:"},{"depth":1,"text":"> >"},{"depth":1,"text":"> >"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > On archlinux, after I upgraded to kernel 7.1.5-arch1-2, the sound volume is"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > significantly lower and seems to lack bass."},{"depth":1,"text":"> >"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > Reported by someone else here:"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > https://bbs.archlinux.org/viewtopic.php?id=314220"},{"depth":1,"text":"> >"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > Previous kernel was 7.0.14.arch1-1 (working)"},{"depth":1,"text":"> >"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > Attached is also-info.sh for 7.1.5-arch1-2 (broken) and 6.18.41-1-lts (as a"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > workaround I installed an lts kernel, works)"},{"depth":1,"text":"> >"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > Device:"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > Bus 005 Device 003: ID 1038:2232 SteelSeries ApS SteelSeries Arctis Nova 5"},{"depth":1,"text":"> >"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > Dmesg diff:"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > Aug 05 16:22:19 framework kernel: usb 5-1.1: 9:0: sticky mixer values (-19712/"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > 0/256 => 0), disabling"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > Aug 05 16:22:19 framework kernel: usb 5-1.1: 10:0: sticky mixer values (-21248"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > /0/256 => 0), disabling"},{"depth":1,"text":"> >"},{"depth":1,"text":"> > Can I need to provide anything else?"},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":"> Could you try 7.2 kernel?  I guess it's still broken, but then try to"},{"depth":1,"text":"> pass the option \"quirk_flags=1038:2232:mixer_get_cur_broken\" to"},{"depth":1,"text":"> snd-usb-audio module and retest?"},{"depth":1,"text":">"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"I tested with the `linux-mainline` package, currently on version 7.2rc5-1"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"# cat /etc/modprobe.d/snd-usb-audio.conf"},{"depth":1,"text":"options snd-usb-audio quirk_flags=1038:2232:mixer_get_cur_broken"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"That seems to have \"fixed\" it."}],"lineCount":40,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Good to hear.  Could you try the patch below?  I'm going to submit it\nin anyway, but it'd be appreciated if you can test it beforehand."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"thanks,"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Takashi"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"-- 8< --"},{"kind":"code","text":"From: Takashi Iwai <tiwai@suse.de>\nSubject: [PATCH] ALSA: usb-audio: Fix mixer regression on SteelSeries Arctis"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":" Nova 5"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"The recent \"sticky mixer\" sanity check in USB-audio driver caused a\nregression on SteelSeries Arctis Nova 5 (1038:2232); because the\nfirmware doesn't handle GET_CUR requests, some mixers are effectively\ndisabled, leading to the too low / soft volumes:\n  usb 5-1.1: 9:0: sticky mixer values (-19712/0/256 => 0), disabling\n  usb 5-1.1: 10:0: sticky mixer values (-21248/0/256 => 0), disabling"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Restore the functionality by ignoring GET_CUR errors intentionally\nwith MIXER_GET_CUR_BROKEN quirk."},{"kind":"code","text":"Fixes: 86aa1ea1f15c (\"ALSA: usb-audio: Do not expose sticky mixers\")"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Reported-by: Gert Burger <gertburger@gmail.com>"},{"kind":"code","text":"Closes: https://lore.kernel.org/CAEQ1D3kdA3mkQx7ei9Kq0gwky0qroJqCLKrkvgfkqgTbeu086A@mail.gmail.com\nLink: https://bbs.archlinux.org/viewtopic.php?id=314220"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Signed-off-by: Takashi Iwai <tiwai@suse.de>"},{"kind":"patch","patchId":"patch:87ecgbecy8.wl-tiwai@suse.de:3:0"}],"patchIds":["patch:87ecgbecy8.wl-tiwai@suse.de:3:0"],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":3,"diagnostics":[],"declaredParentMessageId":"CAEQ1D3ky_7+g6_1J7ymxGUq4DNrPyx8OCsQ8Z42j2-XncMW8ZQ@mail.gmail.com","parentId":"CAEQ1D3ky_7+g6_1J7ymxGUq4DNrPyx8OCsQ8Z42j2-XncMW8ZQ@mail.gmail.com"},"CAEQ1D3kmssJk=ZFiiV1wLUpC9BTnu7RNjuLopYDU0XpocVNNCQ@mail.gmail.com":{"id":"CAEQ1D3kmssJk=ZFiiV1wLUpC9BTnu7RNjuLopYDU0XpocVNNCQ@mail.gmail.com","messageId":"CAEQ1D3kmssJk=ZFiiV1wLUpC9BTnu7RNjuLopYDU0XpocVNNCQ@mail.gmail.com","references":["CAEQ1D3kdA3mkQx7ei9Kq0gwky0qroJqCLKrkvgfkqgTbeu086A@mail.gmail.com","871pcbg3wr.wl-tiwai@suse.de","CAEQ1D3ky_7+g6_1J7ymxGUq4DNrPyx8OCsQ8Z42j2-XncMW8ZQ@mail.gmail.com","87ecgbecy8.wl-tiwai@suse.de"],"missingAncestorIds":[],"author":{"name":"Gert Burger","address":"gertburger@gmail.com"},"replyTo":[],"to":[{"name":"Takashi Iwai","address":"tiwai@suse.de"}],"cc":[{"name":"","address":"linux-sound@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"regressions@lists.linux.dev"}],"timestamp":{"raw":"2026-08-10T11:31:38.000Z","iso":"2026-08-10T11:31:38.000Z","valid":true},"subject":"Re: [REGRESSION] snd-usb-audio: SteelSeries Arctis Nova 5 mixer controls disabled as sticky","mailingLists":[{"id":"regressions.lists.linux.dev","displayName":"regressions.lists.linux.dev"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"quote","attribution":"On Thu, 6 Aug 2026 at 11:54, Takashi Iwai <tiwai@suse.de> wrote:","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Good to hear.  Could you try the patch below?  I'm going to submit it"},{"depth":1,"text":"in anyway, but it'd be appreciated if you can test it beforehand."},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"diff --git a/sound/usb/quirks.c b/sound/usb/quirks.c"},{"depth":1,"text":"index 3330eb604911..618baa80d2b7 100644"},{"depth":1,"text":"--- a/sound/usb/quirks.c"},{"depth":1,"text":"+++ b/sound/usb/quirks.c"},{"depth":1,"text":"@@ -2363,6 +2363,8 @@ static const struct usb_audio_quirk_flags_table quirk_flags_table[] = {"},{"depth":1,"text":"                   QUIRK_FLAG_SHARE_MEDIA_DEVICE | QUIRK_FLAG_ALIGN_TRANSFER),"},{"depth":1,"text":"        DEVICE_FLG(0x1038, 0x1294, /* SteelSeries Arctis Pro Wireless */"},{"depth":1,"text":"                   QUIRK_FLAG_MIXER_PLAYBACK_MIN_MUTE),"},{"depth":1,"text":"+       DEVICE_FLG(0x1038, 0x2232, /* SteelSeries Arctis Nova 5 */"},{"depth":1,"text":"+                  QUIRK_FLAG_MIXER_GET_CUR_BROKEN),"},{"depth":1,"text":"        DEVICE_FLG(0x1101, 0x0003, /* Audioengine D1 */"},{"depth":1,"text":"                   QUIRK_FLAG_GET_SAMPLE_RATE),"},{"depth":1,"text":"        DEVICE_FLG(0x12d1, 0x3a07, /* HUAWEI USB-C HEADSET */"},{"depth":1,"text":"--"},{"depth":1,"text":"2.55.0"},{"depth":1,"text":""}],"lineCount":20,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Sorry for the late reply,"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"it does work on the mainline package i have."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Regards"}],"patchIds":[],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":4,"diagnostics":[],"declaredParentMessageId":"87ecgbecy8.wl-tiwai@suse.de","parentId":"87ecgbecy8.wl-tiwai@suse.de"}},"rootIds":["931ce21d-6ec1-4502-bf5d-d3017626cc95@leemhuis.info","871pcbg3wr.wl-tiwai@suse.de"],"childrenByParent":{"871pcbg3wr.wl-tiwai@suse.de":["CAEQ1D3ky_7+g6_1J7ymxGUq4DNrPyx8OCsQ8Z42j2-XncMW8ZQ@mail.gmail.com"],"CAEQ1D3ky_7+g6_1J7ymxGUq4DNrPyx8OCsQ8Z42j2-XncMW8ZQ@mail.gmail.com":["87ecgbecy8.wl-tiwai@suse.de"],"87ecgbecy8.wl-tiwai@suse.de":["CAEQ1D3kmssJk=ZFiiV1wLUpC9BTnu7RNjuLopYDU0XpocVNNCQ@mail.gmail.com"]},"chronologicalIds":["931ce21d-6ec1-4502-bf5d-d3017626cc95@leemhuis.info","871pcbg3wr.wl-tiwai@suse.de","CAEQ1D3ky_7+g6_1J7ymxGUq4DNrPyx8OCsQ8Z42j2-XncMW8ZQ@mail.gmail.com","87ecgbecy8.wl-tiwai@suse.de","CAEQ1D3kmssJk=ZFiiV1wLUpC9BTnu7RNjuLopYDU0XpocVNNCQ@mail.gmail.com"],"patchSeries":[],"diagnostics":[],"patches":{"patch:87ecgbecy8.wl-tiwai@suse.de:3:0":{"id":"patch:87ecgbecy8.wl-tiwai@suse.de:3:0","messageId":"87ecgbecy8.wl-tiwai@suse.de","subject":"Re: [REGRESSION] snd-usb-audio: SteelSeries Arctis Nova 5 mixer controls disabled as sticky","commitMessage":[],"files":[{"oldPath":"sound/usb/quirks.c","newPath":"sound/usb/quirks.c","displayPath":"sound/usb/quirks.c","status":"modified","hunks":[{"header":"@@ -2363,6 +2363,8 @@ static const struct usb_audio_quirk_flags_table quirk_flags_table[] = {","oldStart":2363,"oldCount":6,"newStart":2363,"newCount":8,"lines":[{"kind":"context","text":"\t\t   QUIRK_FLAG_SHARE_MEDIA_DEVICE | QUIRK_FLAG_ALIGN_TRANSFER),","oldLine":2363,"newLine":2363},{"kind":"context","text":"\tDEVICE_FLG(0x1038, 0x1294, /* SteelSeries Arctis Pro Wireless */","oldLine":2364,"newLine":2364},{"kind":"context","text":"\t\t   QUIRK_FLAG_MIXER_PLAYBACK_MIN_MUTE),","oldLine":2365,"newLine":2365},{"kind":"addition","text":"\tDEVICE_FLG(0x1038, 0x2232, /* SteelSeries Arctis Nova 5 */","newLine":2366},{"kind":"addition","text":"\t\t   QUIRK_FLAG_MIXER_GET_CUR_BROKEN),","newLine":2367},{"kind":"context","text":"\tDEVICE_FLG(0x1101, 0x0003, /* Audioengine D1 */","oldLine":2366,"newLine":2368},{"kind":"context","text":"\t\t   QUIRK_FLAG_GET_SAMPLE_RATE),","oldLine":2367,"newLine":2369},{"kind":"context","text":"\tDEVICE_FLG(0x12d1, 0x3a07, /* HUAWEI USB-C HEADSET */","oldLine":2368,"newLine":2370},{"kind":"deletion","text":"- ","oldLine":2369},{"kind":"metadata","text":"2.55.0"},{"kind":"metadata","text":""},{"kind":"metadata","text":""}]}],"binary":false}],"trailers":[],"rawText":"diff --git a/sound/usb/quirks.c b/sound/usb/quirks.c\nindex 3330eb604911..618baa80d2b7 100644\n--- a/sound/usb/quirks.c\n+++ b/sound/usb/quirks.c\n@@ -2363,6 +2363,8 @@ static const struct usb_audio_quirk_flags_table quirk_flags_table[] = {\n \t\t   QUIRK_FLAG_SHARE_MEDIA_DEVICE | QUIRK_FLAG_ALIGN_TRANSFER),\n \tDEVICE_FLG(0x1038, 0x1294, /* SteelSeries Arctis Pro Wireless */\n \t\t   QUIRK_FLAG_MIXER_PLAYBACK_MIN_MUTE),\n+\tDEVICE_FLG(0x1038, 0x2232, /* SteelSeries Arctis Nova 5 */\n+\t\t   QUIRK_FLAG_MIXER_GET_CUR_BROKEN),\n \tDEVICE_FLG(0x1101, 0x0003, /* Audioengine D1 */\n \t\t   QUIRK_FLAG_GET_SAMPLE_RATE),\n \tDEVICE_FLG(0x12d1, 0x3a07, /* HUAWEI USB-C HEADSET */\n-- \n2.55.0\n\n","statistics":{"files":1,"additions":2,"deletions":1},"diagnostics":[]}}}}